<title>FINLAND: ENSKILDA SETS FIM 100 MLN LOAN FOR VOLVO.</title>
<headline>ENSKILDA SETS FIM 100 MLN LOAN FOR VOLVO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>S-E Banken said in a statement received on Monday it was sole manager for a 100 million markka five-year step-up loan for Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal pays 4.45 percent until July 1, 1999, when the deal is callable,&quot; it said, adding that if not called, the coupon on the loan would rise to 6.35 percent.</p>
<p>The loan was the first in markka for Volvo, said an official at S-E Banken in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
